                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The monaciello pulls a desirable object from its sack. Each creature within 15 feet who can see the object immediately covets it and must attempt a @Check[will|dc:17] save. If the monaciello spends two actions on Heart's Desire, this must be a real object already in their possession. If they spend three actions, they can cast illusory object as part of the activity, which gains the subtle trait.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1} for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is slowed 1 for 1 round and, if it doesn't have a free hand, must spend its first action on its next turn to Release one item it's holding to grab for the object instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 2} instead.</p>"
